Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Swagger UI not loading

Solution: Check if port 5000 is available: sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 5000
Kill existing process: sudo kill -9 <PID>
Issue: Import errors for flask_restx

Solution: Ensure virtual environment is activated and packages installed
source ~/swagger-lab/venv/bin/activate
pip install flask flask-restx werkzeug==2.3.0
Issue: Validation errors not showing

Solution: Ensure validate=True is set in @ns.expect() decorator
Issue: Models not appearing in Swagger UI

Solution: Verify @ns.marshal_with() and @ns.expect() decorators are used correctly
